Z||000005||Fformula88||09-15-2001||10:30 AM||||Honda Civics... the problem is not the cars... but the owners!  Its not the cars fault people bolt fart-can exhausts to them and cover them with ugly decals.  <P>I recently saw a writeup on a Civic owner who has sunk $30,000 into his Civic!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif">  Plus the cost of the car, he could have had an awfully nice sports car, but he'd be hard press to find a better performer.  He is getting 340 horses out of that thing, and in that light of a car thats a lot of power!  I still wouldn't sink that kind of $$ into a Civic!  <P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero2m6siga.JPG">   <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
