Z||000009||Cooter||09-15-2001||10:25 PM||||My daily driver is a '90 Civic. I am a reformed Ricer and found this forum when I first bought my 85 SE. Since then, I have grown up, got rid of the Civic's header/stainless glass pack setup and have been pretty happy with both cars. The funny thing about putting the factory exhaust back on the Civic, it went from getting 24-25 MPG back to getting over 30. And just think, a header is supposed to help effeciency!||||reg||1
